{
	// Project snippets for hun-bot.dev content. Guide: docs/content/snippets.md
	// Frontmatter defaults are deliberately the blog's own placeholder values
	// ('설명 입력', 'tag', 'series 이름'): if one is left unedited, getAllPosts()
	// excludes the post and `npm run blog:validate` warns, so a half-filled post
	// can never go live. New posts also start as `draft: true`.

	// ───────────── Blog frontmatter, one per folder ─────────────

	"Study note (study/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-study",
		"description": "src/content/blog/{lang}/study/ — lecture/study note. Draft by default; Study Engine reads the anki block.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:제목}'",
			"description: '${2:설명 입력}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"tags: ['${3:tag}']",
			"category: '${4|공부,ai engineering,paper|}'",
			"series: '${5:series 이름}'",
			"seriesOrder: ${6:1}",
			"# informedBy: ['devlog/...']   # blog slugs this note grew out of",
			"anki:",
			"  enabled: true",
			"  # deck: 'Study::AI'   # optional; by default tools/study-engine/decks.yaml picks the deck from the folder",
			"  send: ${8|true,false|}        # false = never send this note to an external LLM",
			"---",
			"",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	"Devlog (devlog/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-devlog",
		"description": "src/content/blog/{lang}/devlog/<PROJECT>/ — project development log.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:제목}'",
			"description: '${2:설명 입력}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"# heroImage: '/images/${3:project}/cover.webp'",
			"tags: ['${4:tag}']",
			"category: '${5|devlog,blog_devlog,algo_bot,local_llm_devlog,app_devlog,jp_app_devlog,onpremise_devlog,stock_app_devlog,vsextension_devlog,add_on_doctor_devlog,on-the-block,autonomous_car,chatting_system|}'",
			"series: '${6:series 이름}'",
			"seriesOrder: ${7:1}",
			"---",
			"",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	"Technical note (technical_note/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-tech",
		"description": "src/content/blog/{lang}/technical_note/<TOPIC>/ — technical write-up or code review.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:제목}'",
			"description: '${2:설명 입력}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"tags: ['${3:tag}']",
			"category: '${4|ai engineering,architecture,chatting_system,devlog,공부|}'",
			"# series: '...'",
			"# seriesOrder: 1",
			"---",
			"",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	"Paper post (paper-review/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-paper",
		"description": "src/content/blog/{lang}/paper-review/ — blog post about a paper. For a structured review use fm-areview.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:제목}'",
			"description: '${2:설명 입력}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"tags: ['${3:tag}']",
			"category: '${4|paper_review,paper|}'",
			"# papers: ['paper-card-id']   # src/content/papers entry ids this post is about",
			"---",
			"",
			"## 문제 정의",
			"",
			"$0",
			"",
			"## 핵심 아이디어",
			"",
			"## 결과",
			"",
			"## 한계와 내 생각",
			""
		]
	},

	"Review / hackathon (review/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-review",
		"description": "src/content/blog/{lang}/review/ — program, hackathon or competition review.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:제목}'",
			"description: '${2:설명 입력}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"tags: ['${3:tag}']",
			"category: '${4|review,hackathon|}'",
			"---",
			"",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	"Essay / log (product_thinking/, personal_log/, notes/, retrospective/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-essay",
		"description": "Thoughts, career notes, retrospectives.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:제목}'",
			"description: '${2:설명 입력}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"tags: ['${3:tag}']",
			"category: '${4|thoughts,contemplation,career,retrospective|}'",
			"---",
			"",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	// ───────────── Academic review (src/content/academic-reviews/) ─────────────

	"Academic review (academic-reviews/)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "fm-areview",
		"description": "src/content/academic-reviews/{lang}/ — structured paper review with the review components.",
		"body": [
			"---",
			"draft: true",
			"title: '${1:리뷰 제목}'",
			"pubDate: '$CURRENT_YEAR-$CURRENT_MONTH-$CURRENT_DATE'",
			"tags:",
			"  - '${2:tag}'",
			"paper:",
			"  title: '${3:Paper title}'",
			"  authors:",
			"    - '${4:Author}'",
			"  venue: '${5:Venue}'",
			"  year: ${6:$CURRENT_YEAR}",
			"  url: '${7:https://arxiv.org/abs/}'",
			"# paperId: 'paper-card-id'   # src/content/papers entry id, if a card exists",
			"---",
			"",
			"import KeyTakeaways from '@/components/reviews/KeyTakeaways.astro';",
			"import EquationNote from '@/components/reviews/EquationNote.astro';",
			"import ResultHighlight from '@/components/reviews/ResultHighlight.astro';",
			"import LimitationBlock from '@/components/reviews/LimitationBlock.astro';",
			"import MyCommentary from '@/components/reviews/MyCommentary.astro';",
			"import ReferenceList from '@/components/reviews/ReferenceList.astro';",
			"",
			"<KeyTakeaways items={['${8:핵심 1}']} />",
			"",
			"## 문제 정의",
			"",
			"$0",
			"",
			"## 방법",
			"",
			"## 결과",
			"",
			"## 한계",
			"",
			"<MyCommentary kind=\"critique\">",
			"",
			"</MyCommentary>",
			"",
			"<ReferenceList items={[]} />",
			""
		]
	},

	// ───────────── Study Engine body blocks (docs/study-engine/contracts.md) ─────────────

	"Study note skeleton": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "study-skeleton",
		"description": "Body layout Study Engine extracts best from: definition list, formulas, question headings.",
		"body": [
			"## 용어 정리",
			"",
			"- **${1:용어}:** ${2:정의를 내 말로 한 문장}",
			"",
			"## 공식",
			"",
			"${3:개념}의 식:",
			"",
			"\\$\\$",
			"${4:수식}",
			"\\$\\$",
			"",
			"## ${5:A와 B는 왜 trade-off 관계인가?}",
			"",
			"$0",
			""
		]
	},

	"Definition item (memorize card)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "def",
		"description": "Root-level `- **term:** definition` — Study Engine layer 1 turns it into a memorize card.",
		"body": ["- **${1:용어}:** ${2:정의}"]
	},

	"Anki comment card": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "anki-card",
		"description": "Hidden card (not rendered on the blog). Study Engine layer 2.",
		"body": [
			"{/* anki id=\"${1:card-id}\"",
			"Q: ${2:질문}",
			"A: ${3:답}",
			"*/}"
		]
	},

	"Card break": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "card-break",
		"description": "Force a Study Engine section boundary (not rendered).",
		"body": ["{/* card-break */}"]
	},

	"Block math": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "mathblock",
		"description": "Display math (KaTeX). A block with a preceding sentence becomes a formula card.",
		"body": ["\\$\\$", "${1:x}", "\\$\\$"]
	},

	"Formula with meaning (two memorize cards)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "formula",
		"description": "Concept sentence + display math + symbol list. Study Engine makes concept → formula and formula → concept/symbols cards (D12). Keep symbol lines without bold so they are not read as definitions.",
		"body": [
			"${1:개념}의 식:",
			"",
			"\\$\\$",
			"${2:수식}",
			"\\$\\$",
			"",
			"- ${3:기호}: ${4:의미}",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	"Code pattern card": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "codecard",
		"description": "`X 사용법:` + a code block + key points. Study Engine makes a recognition card: code + choices → X (D13). Keep the points without bold.",
		"body": [
			"${1:Promise} 사용법:",
			"",
			"```${2|js,ts,python,bash|}",
			"${3:코드}",
			"```",
			"",
			"- ${4:핵심}: ${5:무엇을 하는지}",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	"Concept set (five slots)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "concept",
		"description": "One concept in the five slots of D13: definition, principle, formula (recognition), compare (trade-off), limitation → next technique.",
		"body": [
			"## ${1:개념}",
			"",
			"- **${1}:** ${2:정의를 내 말로 한 문장}",
			"",
			"### ${1}은(는) 왜 ${3:이렇게 동작하는가}?",
			"",
			"${4:원리를 내 말로 2–4문장.}",
			"",
			"${1}의 식:",
			"",
			"\\$\\$",
			"${5:수식}",
			"\\$\\$",
			"",
			"- ${6:기호}: ${7:의미}",
			"",
			"### ${1} vs ${8:비교 대상}",
			"",
			"${9:무엇을 얻고 무엇을 잃는지 (trade-off).}",
			"",
			"### ${1}의 한계",
			"",
			"${10:한계}. 그래서 ${11:다음 기술}이 나왔다.",
			"$0"
		]
	},

	// ───────────── Shared components ─────────────

	"Term (margin glossary)": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "term",
		"description": "<Term> margin note. Add the import once per file (import-term).",
		"body": ["<Term term=\"${1:용어}\" title=\"${2:$1}\">${3:설명}</Term>"]
	},

	"Term import": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "import-term",
		"body": ["import Term from '@/components/Term.astro';"]
	},

	"LinkCard": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "linkcard",
		"description": "Inline card for a published on-site page; the build fails if href is not published.",
		"body": [
			"import LinkCard from '@/components/LinkCard.astro';",
			"",
			"<LinkCard href=\"/${1|ko,jp,en|}/blog/${2:category/slug}/\" />"
		]
	},

	"Review: result highlight": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "rv-result",
		"body": ["<ResultHighlight label=\"${1:Benchmark}\" metric=\"${2:Accuracy}\" value=\"${3:0.0}\" baseline=\"${4:0.0}\" delta=\"${5:+0.0}\" />"]
	},

	"Review: equation note": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "rv-eq",
		"body": ["<EquationNote label=\"${1:Equation}\">", "", "\\$\\$", "${2:x}", "\\$\\$", "", "</EquationNote>"]
	},

	"Review: limitation": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "rv-limit",
		"body": ["<LimitationBlock title=\"${1:Limitation}\" severity=\"${2|open,minor,major|}\">", "${3}", "</LimitationBlock>"]
	},

	"Review: my commentary": {
		"scope": "mdx,markdown",
		"prefix": "rv-comment",
		"body": ["<MyCommentary kind=\"${1|critique,interpretation,project|}\">", "${2}", "</MyCommentary>"]
	}
}
